			"Message": "chore(build): remove trailing whitespace in gitmodules configuration\n\n- Eliminates trailing newline in .gitmodules configuration for Queue submodule\n- Maintains consistency with Git's recommended formatting practices\n- Part of ongoing codebase hygiene efforts to reduce noise in diffs\n\nThis minor formatting change improves configuration file cleanliness without affecting functionality. The Queue submodule remains a critical dependency for Land's asynchronous task processing infrastructure.",
			"SHA": "5b472297444691debed734fa0fce595d2fff0ce6"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-11T15:27:17Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				25,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(build): update Queue submodule and track changes\n\n- Update `Queue` submodule to commit 143abae to incorporate latest changes from upstream\n- Remove `ignore = all` directive in .gitmodules to enable tracking of submodule changes\n\nThis change ensures the Land project stays aligned with the current state of the Queue dependency, which is critical for IPC message handling between Mountain and Cocoon components. Actively tracking the submodule will improve dependency management during the Electron-to-Tauri migration by ensuring all contributors use the same Queue version for:\n- Reliable message queuing in the Vine IPC layer\n- Consistent process management in the Track dispatcher\n- Stable RPC communication between extension host and core",
			"SHA": "6786c3af02f3cf1d6bbee2bf97f9b32b4cad25bf"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2025-05-11T01:01:00Z",
